  "question": {
    "text": "How long (approximate) should water be electrolysed by passing through <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>100</mn><mo>&#160;</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>amperes</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>current so that the oxygen released can completely burn <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>27</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>66</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of diborane? (Atomic weight of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
